ign:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">CURRENT REPORT</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:9pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Pursuant to Section 13 OR 15(d) of The Securities Exchange Act of 1934</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:9pt;margin-top:0.05pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Date of Report (Date of earliest event reported): <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="dei:DocumentPeriodEndDate" format="ixt:date-monthname-day-year-en" id="f-2">January 15, 2026</ix:nonNumeric></span></div><div style="text-align:center"><img src="val-20260115_g2.jpg" alt="Image_8.jpg" style="height:0px;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:741px" id="i-2"/></div><div style="margin-top:3pt;text-align:center;text-indent:36pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:14pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="dei:EntityRegistrantName" id="f-3">GRI BIO, INC.</ix:nonNumeric></span></div><div style="margin-bottom:9pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(Exact name of registrant as specified in its charter)</span></div><div style="margin-top:1.25pt;padding-left:31.85pt;padding-right:31.85pt;text-align:center;text-indent:-16.1pt"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:99.953%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:31.693%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.744%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:31.693%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.744%"/><td style="width:0